description: No Cursor co-author trailers in git commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or any Cursor/AI attribution trailer to commits.

When committing, avoid `git commit` if the environment injects that trailer — use `git commit-tree` + `git update-ref` (or equivalent) so the message is exactly what was written.

Do not rewrite already-pushed history to strip trailers unless the user explicitly asks for a force-push rewrite.
